1. Own and grow strategic accounts across DIY, Consumer Electronics, Specialist Retail and Distribution;
2. Build strong relationships with buyers, category managers and senior decision-makers;
3. Develop new accounts and channels, particularly in DIY, Electrical/Solar, Energy and Professional channels;
4. Lead commercial negotiations including pricing, rebates, promotions, payment terms and annual agreements;
5. Drive new product and category launches across Portable Power, Balcony Solar and Residential Energy;
6. Manage account performance based on sell-in, sell-through, inventory, forecast and profitability;
7. Work closely with Product, Marketing and Operations to ensure strong execution.

1. 5+ years of Key Account Management, Channel Sales or Business Development experience in DACH;
2. Strong track record with major retailers, distributors or professional channels;
3. Relevant background in Consumer Electronics, DIY, Power Tools, Solar/Energy, Smart Home or related industries;
4. Strong commercial negotiation and account development skills;
5. Both a hunter and an operator — able to win new business and systematically grow existing accounts;
6. Strong analytical and entrepreneurial mindset;
7. Fluent German and professional English, willingness to travel across DACH.

What Success Looks Like
Build strong strategic accounts, open new channels, successfully launch new categories and establish EcoFlow as a long-term energy and technology partner — not simply a hardware supplier.
We are looking for someone who sees DACH as a business to build, not simply a territory to manage.

